w Mekhet has taken up ghost hunting\u2014-to be specific, the disembodied spirits of <i>other</i> Hollow Mekhet. A member of low standing in the Circle of the Crone, he hopes to use a ritual that creates Frankensteinien \u2018blood gods\u2019 (which is canonically a thing, by the way, check out Secrets of the Covenants) and smash in to this \u2018deity\u2019 as many ka as he can.<br /> <br /> What he inadvertently creates is a hulking, swollen abomination, toxic, unconsumable blood waterfalling endlessly from its every orifice, that has gone mad and threatens the Masquerade.<br /> <br /> [And why yes, this IS essentially a <i>very</i> weird Hive-Claimed...]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-23T12:01:28-07:00","id":1487629,"title":"","content":"You been plagued by a series of embarassing situations. Every time you try to feed from a mortal you get interupted by hunters, possible eyewitness or a rival vampire who claims you are trespassing. Your security measures on your haven is malfunctioning and your ghouls are getting hassled with legal troubles and somehow you have offended the Prince and the Primogen at the Elysium with poorly chosen words.<br /> <br /> You been cursed big time and you don't know whom you have angered this much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/mem