deal with a chapter of the Brides of Dracula in which said ghoul would send a fleet of such cars to them in exchange for an item of some importance that the Brides picked up during a heist. The problem is, the warehouse garage that the cars were being kept in has been hit, the cars trashed and the ghoul mechanic MIA. The regent wants the ghoul recovered and the cars replaced before the deadline of the deal is up and the brides either get angry or sell the item to someone else, maybe even the someone else that wrecked the cars and took the mechanic ghoul.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-07T21:21:54-07:00","id":1511044,"title":"","content":"445) You and your coterie are all different bloodlines, who have come together to help support each other with unique strengths and cover each other\u2019s unique weaknesses. Lately, however, you keep running other other vampires, one of each specific bloodline, even those who really shouldn\u2019t be here. Your meetings seem to be total coincidences, but they keep happening. What\u2019s bringing one vampire of every bloodline together in one place, and what do they plan to do with all of you?<br /> <br /> 445a) The God Machine is what brought you here, and demon saboteurs have arrived to try and thwart its plans for you. Do fight this unknown supernatural enemy, or listen long enough to team up against the thing trying to control you? Do you follow the G-M anyways? All the gathered Kindred are split on what to do. No matter what you choose, bloodshed seems inevitable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27217-skyewards","name":"Skyewards","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-27T11:25:48-07:00","id":1518943,"title":"","content":"446. In life, you were a soldier who spent the last quarter of a war that is just barely still in mortal memory in a hellish prison camp. You Try not to think about it too much. lately you\u2019ve been hanging with a touchstone who, like your late older brother, is a brilliant sculptor but otherwise kind of an idiot. Problem is your touchstone has gotten a job at a studio whose elderly owner was the sadist head guard at said prison camp, he goes by a new name now but it is definitely him. You and so many others swore never to forget what that sick fuck and others like him did, so that it would never happen again, so how do you dispense some long deserved justice/revenge without putting your gifted but witless touchstone in potential danger?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-29T09:56:35-07:00","id":1519117,"title":"","content":"You have encountered an ancient in your dealings when you were quite young and your fearful as you messed up one his or her plots and might hold a grudge against you but doesn't and wants to use your skills on a job out of appreciation for making things more entertaining.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-10T06:43:06-07:00","id":1520290,"title":"","content":"448. For the Revolution from Beyond the Final Death.<br /> 2 years ago one of the leading leg breakers for the Firebrands was confirmed eliminated, now she\u2019s back if witnesses are to be believed. Is it merely a lookalike? Someone using The Familiar Stranger? Had she only been beaten into torpor? Or could it have something to do with a young Sangiovanni of her acquaintance? Whatever the reason those on top want to know the answer and so do her former friends who very much believed she was ash in the wind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}